			"Message": "refactor(Maintain): Move free-variable safety check into TryBlockPreserve\n\nRelocate the `IsFreeVarSafe` check and `FindSubstSite` resolution from the main eliminator loop in Inline.rs into `TryBlockPreserve` in mod.rs, where the Preserve-pass text-patching logic actually needs them. The previous placement ran the check unconditionally even though it was only consumed by the Preserve path, and the removed `StmtsBetween` slice computation in Inline.rs was dead work for the AST-rebuild path.\n\nAlongside this structural fix:\n- Flatten all multi-line function signatures in mod.rs to single-line style\n- Replace wildcard destructuring `(Count, _, _)` with rest pattern `(Count, ..)` throughout Count.rs tests\n- Reflow doc comments to consistent line width across Count.rs, Inline.rs, Patch.rs, Safe.rs\n- Normalize one-line test function bodies where they fit on a single line\n- Move `proc-macro2` dependency to workspace-managed version\n\nThe Eliminate transform remains behaviourally identical across both Preserve and AST-rebuild paths.",
